==English==
===Noun===
'''pylorus''' (''plural'' '''pylori''')

# {{anatomy}} The opening in a [[vertebrate]], including [[human]]s, at the lower end of the [[stomach]] that opens into the [[duodenum]].
# A [[muscular]] or [[myovascular]] structure that controls the opening of an orifice or [[lumen]] of an organ.

